 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 46439,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Relocated entry word $B56B followed by body length $0A95 for GS."
  },
  {
   "address": 46443,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Increment $63 twice before inspecting the two-byte counter at $53\u2013$54. The interlude is invoked by the road-completion path at $6DD1."
  },
  {
   "address": 46447,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Right-shift elapsed time $53-$54 and the accumulated speed $55-$57 together until the high time byte is zero."
  },
  {
   "address": 46464,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Repeatedly subtract the remaining byte of elapsed time from the speed subtotal. The quotient in X is written to $BFCC. A zero time bypasses the repeated subtraction."
  },
  {
   "address": 46500,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Add 60 per unit in $69 to the low time byte $68, subtract the per-stage constant from $BFE8 and clamp negative results to zero."
  },
  {
   "address": 46597,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Fetch the stage's word from $BFF2 and derive a points subtotal. The repeated subtraction increments the award by four. The result is written to $BFCD-$BFCE and added to $43-$44."
  },
  {
   "address": 46682,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Choose the final stage display when $52 is 4. Other stages prepare two picture IDs, run DP and GP, and set the interlude IRQ."
  },
  {
   "address": 47088,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Drain pending keyboard input and clear the fire latch. Copy the character ROM range $D800-$DBFF to $E400-$E7FF with I/O switched out, then use CIA timer bytes and the tick counter to select an interlude message."
  },
  {
   "address": 47378,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Read one zero-terminated message line. Skip high-bit bytes, stage remaining glyphs at $BFA4 and fill out the 40-cell line with spaces."
  },
  {
   "address": 47593,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Convert the 16-bit value in A and X to five decimal digits by repeated subtraction. Put the digits in the results text, optionally replacing initial zeroes with $80."
  },
  {
   "address": 47696,
   "type": "line",
